00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:46.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Tends to be more expensive, of course, for leads compared to Meta. Uh, and then conversion rate. So, 7% of the people that click on your ad going onto your site become a lead. So, I'd say that is very high, because the average is 3-5%. So, what I'm seeing on my end, just overall looking at.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:09:03.000
Carmen Cruickshank: our one campaign, is we're getting a solid amount of clicks, because people are searching and see the ad that we put as relevant to what they want, and then they're actually becoming a lead because they see your site, they're like, okay, I actually want to work with these people. Um, then I'm gonna go to… everything else here is just kind of, like.

