00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay, perfect.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:28.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, so on the Meta side, of course, our conversion campaign is bringing in the main leads, so I'm gonna start with that. So we have, in the past 30 days, 32 leads at $10 cost per lead on average, which is really good. That is what we see a lot for venues.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:32.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Spent $305 so far.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:38.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, the main things I'll check, of course, is, again, cost per lead, link clicks, making sure we're getting…

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:44.000
Carmen Cruickshank: the right amount of clicks. The click-through rate looks good, so anything between, of course, like, 1% to 2%.

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.000
Carmen Cruickshank: is definitely relevant.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:51.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And then the landing page views are still very high, because sometimes you get clicks without the landing page views, and that's when things…

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:56.000
Carmen Cruickshank: take a downturn. But for us, everything's looking pretty good there.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:03.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And then, in terms of ads, so we have 3 main ads, just so that each gets a good amount of spend.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:14.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And then our goal, of course, is to refresh these every month, just so that we're not getting any fatigue on the different ads. Uh, our two winners… we have one that I recently released.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:23.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Which is just a collage of everything, kind of showing, like, a little bit of everything interior, exterior, uh, the groom's room, everything like that.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:31.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, and then that brought in $5 cost per lead, 18 leads the past 30 days, and then this one, uh…

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It was like the hard to put into words one.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:39.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And this one just really leads well. I think it just shows all the beautiful scenery.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.000
